# Base-owned paths from the `templates` repo that this project has declined.
#
# `templates/scripts/sync-projects.sh` is additive: it treats any base-owned
# file this repo lacks as a gap and copies it in. A file this repo DELETED on
# purpose is indistinguishable from one it never had, so record the decision
# here or the next sweep proposes it again. One path per line; `#` comments and
# blank lines ignored.

# Deleted in #577. The required status check on `main` is a job NAMED "CI gate",
# and GitHub does not require every check sharing a name to pass — a second,
# trivially-passing emitter satisfies branch protection while ci.yml's real jobs
# are still queued (#457: mergeStateStatus=UNSTABLE, 40 checks pending). ci.yml
# now always runs and its heavy jobs skip on a docs-only diff instead, so
# nothing is left pending for a companion workflow to rescue. Re-proposed by the
# sync in #794; guarded by `apps/web/src/lib/ci_workflow_guards.test.ts` and
# decisions.md § 700.
.github/workflows/ci-gate-docs.yml

# This repo's auditors live under `.claude/agents/auditors/`. A subagent
